<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa offers 30,000 t maize for export/domestic.</title>
<headline>S.Africa offers 30,000 t maize for export/domestic.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa Maize Board said on Wednesday is was offering 30,000 tonnes of yellow maize for either export or domestic use.  </p>
<p>It said the offer would close on November 21.</p>
<p>The Board said the maize, if for export use, would be shipped during December as a single 30,000 tonne unit.</p>
<p>If for domestic use, the minimum price the Board will consider is import parity plus 20 rand a tonne.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
